Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.75,0:00:11.82,Base,,0,0,0,,Every day, we throw away countless things at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:16.53,Base,,0,0,0,,But where do they really go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:27.73,Base,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at the reality of waste and recycling\Nat Shinjeong Middle School.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.03,0:00:37.14,Base,,0,0,0,,Q.  Do students recycle well at our school?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:49.82,Base,,0,0,0,,A.  Most people do a good job, but some plastic bottles\Nare not rinsed or still have their labels on.\NI think we can do a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:01:01.03,Base,,0,0,0,,Some students throw away plastic bottles\Nwithout rinsing them or removing their labels.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.83,0:01:12.02,Base,,0,0,0,,Incorrect sorting means that recyclable materials\Nend up in landfills.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.82,0:01:21.41,Base,,0,0,0,,But this problem is not limited to our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.31,0:01:27.58,Base,,0,0,0,,Waste is a global problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:37.01,Base,,0,0,0,,What we do at school can make a difference\Nbeyond our community.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.51,0:01:44.48,Base,,0,0,0,,①  Empty completely
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:50.02,Base,,0,0,0,,②  Rinse with water
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:55.84,Base,,0,0,0,,③  Remove the label
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.34,0:02:02.85,Base,,0,0,0,,④  Sort it into the correct recycling bin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:13.50,Base,,0,0,0,,As global citizens, change begins with our small habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.30,0:02:23.40,Base,,0,0,0,,Empty, rinse, remove, and sort!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.90,0:02:33.95,Base,,0,0,0,,Let's protect our Earth together,\Nstarting from our Shinjeong Middle School.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.45,0:02:43.35,Base,,0,0,0,,SMALL ACTIONS.  BIG CHANGES.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.25,0:02:50.75,Base,,0,0,0,,START WITH SHINJEONG MIDDLE SCHOOL
